# Auto push / save this Shopify theme

After any theme file change, immediately save and push to Shopify. Do not wait for the user to ask.

- Store: `y9yn6k-me.myshopify.com`
- Theme: `Sira Sculpt` `#154316079173`
- Command from `theme/` folder:

```
shopify theme push --store y9yn6k-me.myshopify.com --theme 154316079173
```

For a small set of files, `--only path` is fine; if unsure, push the full theme.

Do not ask “should I push?” — just push, then report that it was saved.
